        "why": "The W3C does not recommend it as a site-wide rule."
      },
      {
        "text": "None; levels are optional",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "Laws point at AA."
      },
      {
        "text": "AA",
        "correct": true,
        "why": "Right."
      }
    ]
